{"id":"umstand","lemma":"Umstand","pos":"noun","rank":1982,"glosses":["circumstance (an event; a fact; a particular incident)","fuss, trouble, bother (unnecessary activity)"],"ipa":"/ˈʊmʃtant/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/a2/De-Umstand.ogg/De-Umstand.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Umstandes","plural":"Umstände"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich wünschte, die Umstände wären anders.","en":"I wish the circumstances were different.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to wish for","l":"wünschen"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"sein"},{"g":"different, differently"}]},{"text":"Bitte denkt an diesen Umstand.","en":"Please bear this fact in mind.","words":[{"g":"please"},{"g":"to think","l":"denken"},{"g":"at / on"},{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},null]},{"text":"Die Umstände haben sich geändert.","en":"Circumstances have changed.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"have"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"changed"}]},{"text":"Die Umstände sind günstig.","en":"The conditions are favorable.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/789565","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"favourable"}]},{"text":"Ich hoffe, ich mache Ihnen keine Umstände.","en":"I hope I'm not imposing.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to hope","l":"hoffen"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"to make","l":"machen"},{"g":"(to) them","l":"sie"},{"g":"no / not a","l":"kein"},null]}]}